---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import RoadmapExplorer from '../components/roadmap/RoadmapExplorer';
import dashboard from '../generated/project-dashboard.json';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title="RP Project Roadmap · RP Docs" description="Obsidian Project Manager가 관리하는 Recovery Protocol Phase와 작업의 읽기 전용 Table, Gantt, Board 스냅샷." />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header activePage="roadmap" />
		<main class="roadmap-main">
			<header class="roadmap-hero">
				<div>
					<p class="eyebrow">Project Manager / read-only</p>
					<h1>RP Project Roadmap</h1>
					<p>Table, Gantt, Board에서 전체 일정을 살펴보고 항목을 선택해 원본 작업 문서를 사이드 뷰로 확인합니다. 상태·날짜·담당자 수정은 계속 Obsidian Project Manager가 소유합니다.</p>
				</div>
				<a class="dash-link" href="/">Dashboard로 돌아가기 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
			</header>

			<RoadmapExplorer snapshot={dashboard} client:load />
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
